{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_brownb_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_brownb_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"终场铃声","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_brownb_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"08818908fb2b08d35245e4343b4bebb310a80dc4556cb96f52ab4b57b5896f50","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"2:19 P.M. 天气/晴\n乌萨斯边境乡村"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吨吨吨咕咚——呼哈，不错，这啤酒的味道真是爽口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯咳，舒拉女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板，别绷着脸啊。这里的啤酒添加了本地特产的蜂蜜，是非常值得一试的风味哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说了老板，今天是最后一天为你工作了，明天你就要走了，这些天谢谢你照顾我的生意，快来，这杯我请你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"才不要，我坚持健康饮食，不会像某个人，半夜吃空一整罐蜂蜜，第二天又无节制地大量饮用这种含糖量超标的甜酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等下，是你说冰箱里的东西我都可以吃的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——我说了可以吃，但没说肆意吃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你这家伙一点也不在乎身体吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板，做保镖很辛苦的，吃点高油高糖的正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"那也给我克制一点啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，知道啦，老板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，一直想问你，这份工作结束后你有想过将来要做什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（抓头发）嗯呃，想过啊，但是想不到啊，嘶哈，可恶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"其实关于这个，我一直想找个机会和你谈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"两位女士好，这是本店新酿造的特色风味蜂蜜啤酒，今日店庆，买一扎送一扎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，再来一扎！谢谢！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞，这就去给您把杯子打满！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"——谈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎，老板，你刚刚说了什么？这里太多人了，吵得什么也听不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"舒拉，我们得走了，我实在不能再花时间待在这里了，有件重要的事，我想尽快让你知道，这里不是谈话的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然可以咯，老板，我随时紧跟您的步伐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你这个家伙，嗯？唔......嘶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，怎么又不动了？老板你不是急着走吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"舒拉，是我的错觉吗？好像有一个人气势汹汹地朝我们过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"他直直冲你过来了！该死，我就知道中介说你背景清白是骗人的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！你到底在乱想些什么！和你说过多少遍了，我以前只是打地下拳击而已，我才没有混过黑帮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？那个男人可是一脸急切地要和你打招呼呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨这......不过......我确实是认识他啦。老板你别紧张，到我身后来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，这不是我们的拳王小姐嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"识相点滚开行吗，叶甫盖尼，现在我可没空搭理你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么不打拳，改做保镖了？哦，看我这记性，都忘了，你早就不是什么拳王了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你这嘴脸吧，也就只有你这种混蛋会为白捡的冠军扬扬自得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"舒拉......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"（这家伙，变得和平常完全不一样了，好凶啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"就算当时你站上拳台，打败你这种学艺不精的黄毛丫头，对我来说也没有任何难度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你胡扯什么，我这副拳头可是能把你揍个头破血流！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是比赛前一天我被人暗伤无法上场，你今天怎么可能还有机会在这里扯淡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"小丫头别再找借口了，说再多也改变不了你直到比赛结束都没有出现的事实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，气死了，你个混蛋真是一点羞耻心都没有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"生气了？唉，可惜那个老东西了，费了一生心血教出的学生到头来给别人做保镖，真是让人笑掉大牙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，少拿你那张臭嘴提我的老师！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，看你这气鼓鼓的小脸蛋，想打架？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"两位！就此打住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"舒拉女士，我，我不管之前你与他有什么恩怨，但现在，你的时间并不属于你自己，它属于那个付你薪水的人，也就是，我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"所以请不要浪费你的时间，我的金钱，呃......在这种人身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？嗯！对，听你小妞老板的话，夹着尾巴滚吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？老板，我的工作不是刚刚就做完了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你是做完了工作，但下班时间还没到，我今天可是一次性付了八个小时的钱，所以快走吧，舒拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，这我没法反驳，劳务合同上确实写着呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，你看店员的眼神，心里肯定在疯狂祈祷你们两个不要在这里打起来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊，真是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"奥洛夫，你要是不打算来打一场的话，我就走人了，不像你，我可是忙死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你要是还有点骨气，就别再抱着你那便宜冠军炫耀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们再比一场吧，把那场比赛打完，让最后的结果说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过现在，现在还不行，晚些时候，我一定会找上你，我知道你在哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我看算了吧，奥洛夫。说不定结果没什么不同，你还是会像上次一样消失掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，你怕了吗，拳、王、先、生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"当然......没有，怎么可能，比就比，有胆子......你晚上就来找我啊，我还会怕你......不成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你这家伙说够了没！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"臭娘们你——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"舒拉，快走吧，我们还有事，没有大把空闲去找这种人的碴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我得走了。叶甫盖尼，你最好说到做到，晚上见了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"妈的，这种人......哪种人？他妈的那小妞骂我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"narration","text":"6:34 P.M. 天气/多云"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，老板你这么着急把我拉回来，到底想和我说什么啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——你还记得之前我和你说过的“罗德岛”吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是老板你工作的地方，制药公司对吧，你提起的次数可多了，我都记着呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"这次工作结束后你还打算继续做保镖吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，不知道了，应该吧，谁说得上来呢？我们这样的人，有什么干什么，还有什么可挑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛有个职位正需要人，你的个人资质与战斗技巧都很出众，我觉得很适合，所以想向人事推荐你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真，真的吗？这......谢谢你，老板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"何况，你的病症一直发展下去，只会越来越难隐瞒。虽然边境地区管理松散，但待在这里情况只会越来越糟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，老板，原来你这么关心我，不过......我是感染者，真的可以吗？你知道我们这些人......一般公司也不给什么机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"不，别这样说，事实上，我们正需要你这样的干员，罗德岛一直为了让你们......不，我们这样的人有更好的生活而努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我，太好了，也不知道怎么感谢你，啊，真是太难得了，我从来没想过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以，舒拉，别去赴约了吧，你会有新的生活，把那些旧事就丢在这里吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道该怎么和你解释，但我一定要去，这场比赛的结果对我来说，很重要，带着这些旧账我真没法安心离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的事没结束，我也不敢想明天的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"那舒拉......和我讲讲，解释给我听，说服我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前......我一直很希望能戴上那场比赛的冠军腰带，虽然现在腰带是拿不到了，但我还是想证明给......教练......我配得上那条腰带。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，抱歉，我知道，他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（挠头）是，他去世了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小的时候是教练收留了我，出拳、闪避、格挡，都是他教给我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在乌萨斯这地方，他一个人过都很不容易，何况还要带着一个流鼻涕的小鬼头。不管我......他也许能更好过，但他从没这样想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直到最后一刻......他都希望我能赢回那条腰带。我想......除了这个，能为他做的事情也没几件了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"......舒拉，如果这是你的决定，我尊重它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......老板，谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，还有，舒拉，我朝别人打听过那个男人，都说他手脚不太干净，可能是我多心，但你也要小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，我会注意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是赢了，我请你喝珍藏的蜜酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，一言为定！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"narration","text":"10:24 P.M. 天气/晴"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，真是的，这女人真是阴魂不散，谁要和她比啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......说来这女人还真是好运气，当时都那样了，现在居然还能活蹦乱跳的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我可得上纠察队好好聊聊，还能小赚一笔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呦，叶甫盖尼，在这里自言自语什么呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你？！奥洛夫！你......你怎么知道我在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，你这家伙根本就不会乖乖出现在约定好的地方，所以我“碰碰运气”，打算提前守在这里等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我等你太久，出来遛遛弯不行吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，别找借口了，叶甫盖尼，到了这会儿要是害怕就早点认输回家吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"害......怕......想多了，你，奥洛夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"臭女人......你这漂亮小脸蛋不，不怕带血吗，小心我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人的话被一阵拳风打断了，那停在鼻尖不远处的拳头让他把喉咙口的半句话咽进了胃袋里，也让他的心一下提到了嗓子眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别光张嘴了，蠢货，劳你大驾赶紧动动手吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我劝你说话仔细点，别闪了舌头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"贱人......贱人，你，你找死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这家伙的拳头，又密又重，想不到也是有些斤两的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"臭娘们，一直架着手肘格挡算什么，来攻击啊，躲什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你动作太迟钝了！想打到我你得再费点劲儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"妈的找死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是现在，他胳膊抬得够高了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——嗬啊，吃我一拳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拳头狠狠地砸在了男人的肋骨上，痛苦让他仰起头，他的防卫出现了裂隙。\n而舒拉抓住机会，突破防线，贴近他的身体，朝他的下巴狠狠地给出了一击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是现在！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——咳咳，噗，咳，这是......我的牙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，没看错的话，应该是颗大牙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，啊啊啊你......你，你个贱人，去死吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"臭女人，死吧，给我去死，我才是最后的冠军——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叶甫盖尼，你这家伙——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——什么人，唔唔......啊，是什么东西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑影","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，要怪......就......不是时候，得罪......就别想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（听不清了，他......在说什么，可恶，看不清他的脸。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑影","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"再见了，嘿嘿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别走——站住......可恶，比赛就要开始了，偏偏这个时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那是什么......一枚金币......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"narration","text":"被踢开的凶器弹向远处，一滚再滚。男人霎时呆愣住了，一时反应不过来。\n直到乌萨斯女孩一把反扭过男人的手臂将他扯倒在地，用臂弯紧紧钳制住他的脖颈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你手腕上的金币文身是怎么回事？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......咳咳......救命，喘......不上气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年了，我一直在找它，是你，居然是你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来当时暗害我得矿石病的人，就是你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是你这家伙，不是你，我又怎会到今天这个地步！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成为赢家的人本该是我！站上领奖台的人本该是我！拿到那笔奖金的人，也本该是我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"救......命......咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是你的错，你的错，呜——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那笔奖金，我应该拿到的......老头的医药费也能有着落的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么，为什么你非得这么做！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"不......是我，咳，大老板......你不愿，假拳......惹毛他......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想说什么？你不得已！你被迫的！不如我来告诉你好了，你就是个没骨头的小人，这就是你的天性，你他妈就是改不了，对吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......噗......对......不起，错了......放过，咳呃，我......求......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"求你......别杀......我，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......别说了......够了，住口......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我住口！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不能杀你，我不能，该死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一早说过，这是场比赛......我......不能反悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不在赛场上杀人，我不会违背这原则，也不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看......你口水和鼻涕流一脸的样子可真难看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的人生居然被你这废物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵，不值当，为你这种人......真不值，不值......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很幸运，垃圾，滚吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"呃嗬——咳咳咳咳——呼——咳咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这副拳头珍贵得很，用在报复这种事上，浪费了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的拳头，你不配。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......饶命......再也不敢了，咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去之后管好你自己的舌头，要是让我知道你在纠察队那里乱嚼舌根，可饶不了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"饶命......我不敢了，别......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......滚吧，从我眼前消失，再也别让我见到你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，老板，别躲着了，我早听到你的脚步声了，出来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来我出门的时候你根本没睡着啊，老板？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，没有你大晚上在楼底下捶沙袋，我真是一点也睡不着呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为声音应该传不到楼上呢，真不好意思，嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你这家伙，算了，呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我刚刚......差点以为那家伙死定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦——你看到这样的状况就不打算跳出来阻止一下吗？什么嘛，太冷血了，我会害怕的，老板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"别冲我嬉皮笑脸的，我才不是这样的人，当然，舒拉你......也不会是那样的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，就这么相信我吗，老板？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"舒拉，我知道，你有你自己的原则。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......老板，是呀，我呢，就算不再打拳赛了，却还觉得自己是拳手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对面的人倒下了，比赛也就结束了，再下手，就不是拳手该干的事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是不配称之为对手的对手吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，老板，打拳这些年，真正的对手很难遇到，对面的人走了来，来了走，啥样的都有，可脚下的台子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......总是在的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拳台对我来说很重要，所以在那里，我打出的每一拳都不能有惭愧的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼！舒拉，你刚刚挥拳的地方可不是什么正经赛场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板，但我心里一直装着那台子啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"没记错的话，你之前不是在地下拳场吗，在那种环境下坚持原则，很不容易吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，地下拳场里见不得光的东西太多，假拳与赌博都是些表面的玩意儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有门路，再猎奇血腥的比赛都能看到，那里的拳手在观众眼里，连斗兽都算不上，顶多......是玩物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板，那时，差点......我说不定也会走到那一步，变成一个只知道杀戮的怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，老板，你这是什么欣慰的表情啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我想说，舒拉，能有你做我的同事，我很开心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板你......呜——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，老板你说得我都不好意思了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"别高兴得太早了，要是真想入职，你得先自己准备一份简历，再经过面试、评议......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊，老板，我才不要想那么多。你可别再说了，我现在就想来一大杯蜜酒，干完就回去瘫倒睡一觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你这家伙，还想睡觉，你先看看你的鞋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的鞋怎么了？啊，刚刚都没注意到开胶了。嘿嘿，老板，见笑了，穿太久了，一直没换。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——我应该多带了一双，回去先试试，不合适也没办法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我们得赶紧离开这里，谁也不知道那家伙会不会跑去乱嚼舌头，这地方不能再待了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，老板，都怪我把他放走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"别说对不起。那个人的血确实不配沾在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舒拉","speakerId":"avg_137_brownb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的超厉害拳头上？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，是不配沾在你去往新生活的路上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
